OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA grey start
OL,6,Fto the night with outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Facross the north, drier and clearer
OL,8,Fspells can be expected during the
OL,9,Fsecond half of the night before
OL,10,Ffurther cloud and rain moves in
OL,11,FWednesday morning. Breezy in places.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FMostly cloudy with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain, heavy at times.
OL,15,FSome brighter and drier spells to be
OL,16,Fhad in the afternoon but turning windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
